して出演したい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHH9MTB1677A45CPP1B9VJ7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHH9NTP4A9ZFR41HB424E71","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも達成できたらいいなぁ☺️💭\nラーメン大好き齊藤京子"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-keya-35007":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。欅坂46の関有美子です🐱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな米津玄師さんの新しいアルバムを今か今かと心待ちにしております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クロスフェード動画を何回も聴いているのですが絶対全部大好きだと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に『優しい人』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対好きだし全部聴いてしまったら絶対泣いてしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『沙上の夢喰い少女』が本当に大好きで、米津玄師さんの優しい曲が大好きなのです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだかなー( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ!カメラ届きました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く使い方をマスターしたくてお家で練習しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやかけの澤部さんとの勝負企画でいただけたタンブラーの写真を撮りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだカメラを手にして2日目なので、あたたかい目で見てください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/4dd/b918f77248fb3325710d5db099ca5.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br